              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "**Debug Information Exposure**\n\nVulnerabilities exposing sensitive debugging information in production environments\n\n**Impact (type metadata)**\nInformation disclosure, internal system exposure, or aid in further attacks\n\n**Mitigation (type metadata)**\nDisable debug modes in production, remove development code, implement proper error handling"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/psyray/oasis"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "debug-information-exposure",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Vulnerability found\n\nDebugging information is exposed through the use of 'require' statement, which includes a stack trace. In this specific case, the call to the msg.sender.call.value() function will disclose that it is calling a contract function.\n\nImpact: Information disclosure\n\nRemediation: Remove unnecessary debugging statements like 'require(msg.sender.call.value(amount)())' in production."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "/work/project/dataset/clean/simple_dao_fixed.sol"
                },
                "region": {
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "withdraw(uint amount) public {\n  if (credit[msg.sender]>= amount) {\n    credit[msg.sender]-=amount;\n    require(msg.sender.call.value(amount)());\n  }"
                  },
                  "startLine": 24,
                  "endLine": 24
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "oasisModel": "mistral:latest",
            "oasisFileSimilarity": 0.5807370216381913,
            "oasisChunkIndex": 0,
            "oasisFindingIndex": 0
          }
